        "footnotes": [],
        "references": "Our final prediction is a weight summation of the three model families: MoNNs, LSTMs, and GRUs. The inidivual components’ scores and their correlation matrix are shown in Table. 4 and Table. 5. And the weights were 0.40, 0.36, and 0.24 for MoNNs, LSTMs, and GRUs, respectively. Our best score was 0.84185 on Private Leaderboard and 0.84192 on Public Leaderboard. The ensemble gained 0.007 from the best individual component model."
    },
